      {
        "name": "Aggressive Countermeasures",
        "description": "1/round, when you Bolster an ally, you induce a special cycle into their reactor. They reduce the next amount of heat they would take from a hostile character to 0, and that character takes 2 heat and becomes Impaired until the end of their next turn. This effect does not stack, and lasts until triggered.",
